eave  the team or settle down she could grab a  commission briefcase and travel back in  time to be with her  similar to how hazel enjoyed his golden  years with agnes in another timeline  each of the others also loses someone  important to them diego loses lila to  the timeline  although there's a good chance they will  meet again and allison had to give up  her marriage with rey  klaus wasn't able to convince dave not  to go to vietnam  and when ben leaves the earthly plane  he's no longer able to see the girl he  likes from klaus's cult  as for luther when jack ruby disowns him  he loses a father figure he never had  i treated you like a son okay  time to discuss harlan sissy's son who  has gifted vania's telekinetic powers  when she resuscitated him after he  appeared to drown  those little lights that transferred  into him seemed to confirm the theory  that the glowing lights we saw  hargreaves released in the season one  finale are connected to the special  powers inherited by bonya  and likely all 43 super babies born in  1989.  harlan's manifestation of powers  triggers a major alarm at the commission  with the handler recognizing the  importance of the event which is why she  went immediately to take harlem for  herself  like she did with lyla interestingly  though the transference of power from  vania to harlan connects them both even  across distances  harlan goes into a trance when vonya is  being tortured by the fbi  and emerges from it at the same time she  comes out of her shock  harlan can also repel a bullet fired at  him just like vonya did when the swedes  tried to shoot her  and similar to vonya in season 1 when  harlan's emotions get out of control  after the deflected bullet accidentally  kills his father he begins to go  supernova  bonya eventually is able to calm him  down when she removes those golden  lights from his body  however as we see later when he's  levitating one of his bird toys  he still retains at least some of the  powers she g